{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-cost-model","title":"机翻/人审成本模型与分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-localization-production/cost-scale/translation-cost-model","wordCount":2950,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"机翻-人审成本模型与分层\">机翻/人审成本模型与分层</h1><p>本地化预算是跨境电商里少数&quot;看起来可以省、实际上省错地方代价更高&quot;的支出项。把机器翻译的送审比例从 30% 降到 10%，账面成本立刻下降；但如果被省掉的那部分包含商品标题和规格描述，几个月后它会以退货率、客服工单和负评率的形式回来，而且更难归因。所以成本模型的价值不在于&quot;算出一个总数&quot;，而在于<strong>把成本按内容与市场拆开，让每一笔投入都能对上它的收益</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本地化成本的结构可以拆成四个可独立度量的部分，它们的行为差异很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>计价单位</th>\n<th>随规模的变化</th>\n<th>主要可控手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机器翻译</td>\n<td>按字符/词/请求</td>\n<td>近似线性，单价可随量下降</td>\n<td>引擎选择、批量合并、缓存复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工后编辑与审校</td>\n<td>按词/小时/段</td>\n<td><strong>线性且不可压缩到零</strong></td>\n<td>送审比例、后编辑级别、批次效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素材制作（图片/视频）</td>\n<td>按张/按次</td>\n<td>线性，单价高</td>\n<td>模板化、复用、分层替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理与协调</td>\n<td>按项目/按批次</td>\n<td>含固定成本，<strong>随批次碎化而上升</strong></td>\n<td>批次打包、流程自动化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里的关键洞察是：<strong>机翻成本随规模趋于平缓，人成本严格线性，管理成本随批次数量上升。</strong> 三条曲线方向不同，所以&quot;扩大规模&quot;会同时带来单价下降（机翻摊薄）和总成本刚性上升（人成本）——本地化系统能优化的空间，几乎全部集中在&quot;如何减少需要人处理的量与批次数量&quot;上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[内容清单] --&gt; B[分层: 商业价值 × 内容类型]&#10;    B --&gt;|高价值高复用| C[完成 TM/术语资产建设]&#10;    B --&gt;|高价值低复用| D[完整后编辑 + 人工审校]&#10;    B --&gt;|低价值高复用| E[直接上线 + 抽检]&#10;    B --&gt;|低价值低复用| F[机器翻译即上线]&#10;    C --&gt; G[复用率提升 → 机翻量下降]&#10;    D --&gt; H[人成本按预期支出]&#10;    E --&gt; I[抽检成本 + 低风险]&#10;    F --&gt; J[机翻成本 + 抽样监控]&#10;    G --&gt; K[总成本模型]&#10;    H --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[按语种/品类/内容类型归集 → 单位成本报表]\">graph TD\n    A[内容清单] --&gt; B[分层: 商业价值 × 内容类型]\n    B --&gt;|高价值高复用| C[完成 TM/术语资产建设]\n    B --&gt;|高价值低复用| D[完整后编辑 + 人工审校]\n    B --&gt;|低价值高复用| E[直接上线 + 抽检]\n    B --&gt;|低价值低复用| F[机器翻译即上线]\n    C --&gt; G[复用率提升 → 机翻量下降]\n    D --&gt; H[人成本按预期支出]\n    E --&gt; I[抽检成本 + 低风险]\n    F --&gt; J[机翻成本 + 抽样监控]\n    G --&gt; K[总成本模型]\n    H --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[按语种/品类/内容类型归集 → 单位成本报表]</pre><p>分层的两个轴是<strong>商业价值</strong>（这个商品/这个市场带来多少营收）与<strong>复用度</strong>（这类内容有多少可复用的历史资产）。两个轴组合出的四个象限对应四种完全不同的处理配置，而不是一个统一策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本公式与它的参数\">成本公式与它的参数</h2><p>把前面几篇讲过的机制合成一个可计算的总成本式，是成本模型的核心工作。以单个市场为范围：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>asset</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>mgmt</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\sum_{t} N_t \\left[ c^{MT}_t (1 - r_t) + c^{PE}_t \\cdot p_t \\right] + C_{\\text{asset}} + C_{\\text{mgmt}} \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">asset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mgmt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中各符号的含义是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：内容类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的段数（或字数）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{MT}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该类型未复用段的机器翻译单位成本；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该类型的复用率（TM 模糊匹配以上所占比例，性能机制见 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/translation-memory-termbase\">1.2 翻译记忆库与术语库复用</a>）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{PE}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该类型送人处理时的单位成本（按后编辑级别不同，见 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/mt-postedit-flow\">1.1 机翻→术语替换→人审流水线</a> 的分级表）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该类型的送审比例（由门禁阈值决定，见 <a href=\"../quality-gate/mt-quality-score\">2.1 机器翻译质量分与路由</a>）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>asset</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{asset}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">asset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该市场的素材制作成本（图片与视频，见 <a href=\"../cultural-adaptation/2-image-localize\">3.2 商品图片本地化</a>）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>：批次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>mgmt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{mgmt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mgmt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每批的固定管理成本（派单、说明、结算、沟通）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个式子有三个非平凡的推论，值得逐条说明。</p>\n<p><strong>推论一：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的边际成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{PE}\\_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1513em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，而它的收益是&quot;减少误放行的期望损失&quot;。</strong> 因此最优的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满足：提高一个百分点的送审比例所增加的人成本，等于它减少的误放行损失。这意味着<strong>每个内容类型的最优送审比例不同</strong>，而且这个值会随着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{PE}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（该类型的后编辑单价）与内容商业价值的变化而变化。把送审比例设成全局常数，等于假设所有内容的这两个量都相同——这在电商场景里显然不成立。</p>\n<p><strong>推论二：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>mgmt</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{mgmt}} \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mgmt</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 这一项让&quot;批次越多越贵&quot;，因此它与上下文完整性之间存在权衡。</strong> 这是 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/localization-workflow-status\">1.3 翻译任务排期与状态管理</a> 中提到的&quot;批次切分最优点&quot;在成本侧的表达式。实践中，小批次的管理成本常常被严重低估，因为它不计入任何一份翻译报价单，只体现在项目管理的实际人天上。</p>\n<p><strong>推论三：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>asset</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{asset}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">asset</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 无关，是纯粹的市场级固定成本。</strong> 这解释了为什么图片本地化必须按市场价值分层：一个只带来少量订单的长尾市场，如果做了完整的场景素材本地化，其单位成本会远高于核心市场。理性的做法是长尾市场只做&quot;图内文字替换 + 禁忌规避&quot;，不做素材重制（判断逻辑见 <a href=\"../cultural-adaptation/2-image-localize\">3.2</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个实用的检查是<strong>单位成本指标</strong>：按&quot;每千 SKU 每语种的本地化成本&quot;或&quot;每个市场每百万营收的本地化投入&quot;来归集。前者用于横向比较市场间的效率，后者用于判断某个市场的本地化投入是否值得继续加码。这两个指标的区别很重要——一个市场的人均单位成本高，可能只是因为它做的是低复用率的富内容（合理），而不是因为效率低（需要整改）。<strong>只有把成本与内容结构一起看，成本数字才有解释力。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"计价与采购-几处容易吃亏的地方\">计价与采购：几处容易吃亏的地方</h2><p>成本模型落到实际支出时，有几处行业惯例带来的陷阱值得记录。</p>\n<p><strong>按词计价与按小时计价的取舍。</strong> 按词计价在译员效率稳定时对采购方更有利（成本可预测）；按小时计价在内容难度波动大时对译员更公平，但会让成本变得不可预测。商品内容的常见切法是：<strong>标准化内容按词计价，创译类与高难度内容按小时计价</strong>——因为创译的工作量主要由思考而非字数决定，按词计价会诱导译员对短文案草率处理。</p>\n<p><strong>字数口径必须明确。</strong> &quot;按词&quot;在中文、日文、韩文等语言里没有天然对应（这些语言通常按字符或按&quot;千字符&quot;计价），源语言按字、目标语言按词会导致同一个项目的报价在语种之间不可比。合同中应明确&quot;以哪一方的哪一侧计数&quot;。（同源问题也出现在机器翻译的计费上：主流云翻译 API 按字符计费，因此在报价与成本公式里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{MT}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的&quot;字符&quot;口径必须与供应商一致；Cloud Translation 的计价说明见 <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/translate/pricing）\">https://cloud.google.com/translate/pricing）</a></p>\n<p><strong>低复用率内容的单价必须事先约定。</strong> 如果供应商的报价基于&quot;预期复用率 60%&quot;，而实际交付内容复用率只有 20%，译员会以远低于预期效率工作，项目必然出问题。所以合同里应该约定：复用率的<strong>定义方式</strong>（匹配档位阈值）、<strong>测量方法</strong>（由谁的工具统计）、以及<strong>未达预期时的调整机制</strong>。这一条与 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/translation-memory-termbase\">1.2</a> 中的杠杆率公式直接相关：如果不把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的口径写清楚，&quot;复用率&quot;在不同方的报表里可以差出几十个百分点（TM 模糊匹配的百分比在不同工具间本来就不可直接比较，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Translation_memory）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Translation_memory）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>返工成本要预先界定。</strong> 因术语库错误、源文本歧义或规范不清导致的返工，责任方不同，费用承担也不同。规范的审校体系会把错误归因到四类根因（见 <a href=\"../quality-gate/reviewer-guideline\">2.3 审校规范与抽检</a>），这个归因框架同时也是界定返工责任的依据——<strong>先有归因框架，再谈费用分担</strong>，否则每次返工都会变成一次扯皮。</p>\n<p><strong>最后，也是最容易被跳过的一项：产能的预留成本。</strong> 前文提到排期应保留 15%–25% 的缓冲产能（见 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/localization-workflow-status\">1.3</a>）。这块产能平时不产出，但它是有成本的（要么付给固定供应商，要么以更高单价从弹性供应商采购）。成本模型应当把它显式列为一笔<strong>可用性溢价</strong>，而不是当作&quot;没有发生支出&quot;。把它隐藏起来的后果是：每次突发需求发生时，团队都会认为&quot;这次超支是意外&quot;，而事实上它一直是可预测的成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模化的三个杠杆\">规模化的三个杠杆</h2><p>把成本模型当作工具用，能识别出三个真正能改变成本结构的杠杆，按效果量级排列。</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆一：提高复用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，尤其是把低档匹配提升到中档。</strong> 这一条的收益来自 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/translation-memory-termbase\">1.2</a> 中杠杆率公式的性质——提升发生在成本系数高的档位才有意义。具体手段包括：统一分段策略使历史文本更可能对齐（分段机制见 <a href=\"../localization-pipeline/mt-postedit-flow\">1.1</a>）、把商品描述的模板化程度提高（同品类商品共用句式）、以及把创译产出沉淀为可复用短语。这条杠杆的效果通常最显著，因为它同时降低机翻量与人审量。</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆二：只翻变更内容。</strong> 这是纯节省，不牺牲质量：存量商品的重复刷新是本地化支出里最大的一块&quot;白花钱&quot;。其机制与实现细节是下一篇的主题，见 <a href=\"incremental-translate\">4.2 增量翻译：只翻变更内容</a>。这里只需记住它的成本效果：<strong>在没有增量能力的系统里，一次详情页改写会导致整页在十五个语种上重译；有增量能力的系统只处理真正变化的段。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>杠杆三：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从经验值改为校准值。</strong> 这一条的效果取决于原本的送审比例离最优值有多远。过去多数团队把送审比例设得偏保守（宁可多审），因为&quot;省下的审计费&quot;是隐性的而&quot;出错的损失&quot;是显性的——这是一种合理的组织性偏误，但它有真实成本。把阈值校准建立在人工标注样本上（方法见 <a href=\"../quality-gate/mt-quality-score\">2.1</a>），并用线上效果数据验证（方法见 <a href=\"localization-quality-analytics\">4.3 本地化质量与转化效果分析</a>），可以把送审比例精确地推到最优附近。</p>\n<p>三个杠杆有一个共同点：<strong>它们都不需要&quot;更努力&quot;，只需要&quot;更清楚&quot;</strong>——清楚哪一档匹配值得优化、清楚哪些段真的变了、清楚每一档阈值对应多少误放行损失。这也是成本模型的真正用途：它不是记账工具，而是<strong>决策的依据</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>成本四项（机翻、人审、素材、管理）行为不同：机翻随规模摊薄、人审严格线性、管理成本随批次数量上升；优化空间集中在&quot;减少需人处理的量与批次数量&quot;。</li>\n<li>总成本式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msup><mo>∗</mo><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>asset</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>mgmt</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\sum_t N_t [c^{MT}_t(1-r_t) + c^{PE}*t p_t] + C*{\\text{asset}} + C_{\\text{mgmt}} \\cdot B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.141em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">asset</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mgmt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的三个推论：送审比例应按内容类型分别最优化、批次切分存在由管理成本决定的最优点、素材成本是市场级固定成本。</li>\n<li>单位成本指标要区分&quot;每千 SKU 每语种&quot;（比较效率）与&quot;每百万营收&quot;（判断投入是否值得），且必须与内容结构一起看。</li>\n<li>采购上要明确：计价方式与计价方、字数口径、复用率的定义与测量方法、返工成本的归因依据、以及缓冲产能作为显式的可用性溢价。</li>\n<li>三个规模杠杆：提高复用率（尤其把低档匹配提升到中档）、只翻变更内容（见 <a href=\"incremental-translate\">4.2</a>）、把送审比例从经验值改为校准值（见 <a href=\"../quality-gate/mt-quality-score\">2.1</a> 与 <a href=\"localization-quality-analytics\">4.3</a>）。</li>\n<li>成本模型的用途是决策而非记账；它的输入参数全部来自本 hub 前三章的具体机制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"机翻/人审成本模型与分层","id":"机翻-人审成本模型与分层"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本公式与它的参数","id":"成本公式与它的参数"},{"level":2,"text":"计价与采购：几处容易吃亏的地方","id":"计价与采购-几处容易吃亏的地方"},{"level":2,"text":"规模化的三个杠杆","id":"规模化的三个杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"单位/规格/合规标签本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-localization-production/cultural-adaptation/unit-spec-compliance"},"next":{"title":"增量翻译：只翻变更内容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-localization-production/cost-scale/incremental-translate"}}